{"title":"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are several sets of three different numbers whose sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> which can be chosen from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/f/a4fb898cd3c47592929037518c91ba872c79954c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" />.  How many of these sets contain a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc62436e1612a55d60f6bc202adeebdda890a399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the three-element set be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/7/c971b90f12e27cac71559d805181888294f4f732.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ a,b,c \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> and suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/53897e4b47f6049266b4bffcef91bc949385b5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>We need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18e2a258cd24f641f7ad3167ff7a712a220a8d12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0865de67239d4cf389bd082dc5db8dbe32917d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\neq c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"18\" />.  This gives us four solutions, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> sets with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> also with the desired properties <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c7bd0405fbbb5738f1fb332313227996c68ae6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"46\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME\" title=\"1991 AJHSME\">1991 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_P